(text "N64 / M64 HOST EDGE" (at 35.56 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "69ec7a4a-b17e-5558-a41f-bf2b58ad0a07"))
(text "SNES / SUPER FAMICOM SOCKET" (at 226.06 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1b3d91f3-60d2-5a5d-b961-8ba5cd0fe3fb"))
(text "Same 50-contact interface for both host systems" (at 35.56 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc5d84d8-1f2d-541d-800f-4d702c968ae9"))
(text "All 62 contacts retained, including analog cartridge audio" (at 226.06 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61f55c0e-faa0-51bf-8e98-73aaa457418a"))
(text "HOST INTERFACE\n3.3 V logic; power inputs remain separate from local rails.\nAD[15:0] is bidirectional. CIC_DATA / JOYBUS require release.\nReserved contacts and audio are identified only; no drivers fitted.\nHOST_12V is reserved, with no selected load. No 5 V edge supply." (at 30.48 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2575fe16-5c39-59fa-9972-efa9fe46d1c5"))
(text "SNES INTERFACE\n5 V cartridge logic requires reviewed translation and isolation.\nSNES_5V_CART: protected switched supply, default OFF (pending).\nSystem RESET must support cartridge assertion and input sensing.\nCIC_SLAVE_RESET is separate; AUDIO_L/R_IN are analog inputs.\nNo universal NC contacts. Full pin behavior is recorded in the CSV." (at 220.98 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fd2e6e89-ac40-53e3-9a0e-cc0740cb8317"))
(text "DRAFT BOUNDARY: cartridge connectors + USB programmer child sheet. Main FPGA, system power, cartridge translation and A/V remain pending.\nOnly GND is common between the two connectors. Matching names within one domain identify the same net; _N means active low.\nConnector pin types are passive; electrical directions and source evidence are in interfaces/*.csv and docs/design/*-interface-notes.md." (at 20.32 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bea83f6f-71a3-5b99-ab08-bb5d8ddf9d77"))
